window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Award-winning KVM Fall 2023 #1 in SciFi/Fantasy/Dark Romance-<br> Top Faved-Mature Audiences NA+<br> Join Dalia as she maneuvers to survive the hunters &amp; lovers of her DNA.</b><br> <br> <i>I had the double-edged dagger wrapped around his throat before the monster could even calculate his predicament! A surge of adrenaline kicked in, as I heard Christa cry out in pain. This caused me to dig deep with my sharp, deadly, instrument. It plunged into left side of the Guardian's main artery with great force.<br> I was from the Wild, after all.</i><br> <br> <b>Join me as we venture to the finale of the Blood Reign Series. Who will survive, who will die, and who will Dalia end up with? Kaine, Darius, or another more nefarious creature... Hurry and find out!</b></p>"; 
